{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to your Aptitude Exam Confiner!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This evaluation includes basic training, ship configuration, and a live commission trial. Performance will determine your eligibility as an official Confiner. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001260/extras/037838fc74750b026a67484b8cb9d0d8.poster.avif?t=1759405391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001260/extras/037838fc74750b026a67484b8cb9d0d8.webm?t=1759405391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001260/extras/037838fc74750b026a67484b8cb9d0d8.mp4?t=1759405391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simulated Hangar System \u2014 Experimental Configuration Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Access a controlled loadout environment with a predetermined pool of weapon parts and ship modules. Within this test space, you are granted full freedom to configure your Phaige unit and explore different builds before deployment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001260/extras/53910f9250359a1d811c1864f38c20c6.poster.avif?t=1759405391\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001260/extras/53910f9250359a1d811c1864f38c20c6.webm?t=1759405391\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001260/extras/53910f9250359a1d811c1864f38c20c6.mp4?t=1759405391\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURE LIST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic training for the newly inducted Confiner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simulated Hangar to test out your ship configurations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy your ship for field testing in a trial commission.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Towards a brighter future,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The PhaigeX MegaCorp.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001260?t=1759405391","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4001260?t=1759405391","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001260/34ab67a800a3ed1cb4cfee84cbcb7d4e3784c1ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759405391","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4001260/34ab67a800a3ed1cb4cfee84cbcb7d4e3784c1ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759405391","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to your Aptitude Exam Confiner!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This evaluation includes basic training, ship configuration, and a live commission trial. Performance will determine your eligibility as an official Confiner. Good luck!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline po